    },
    {
      "id": "alex-reply-3954cefd12de42348dd3f97a1beff082",
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 3,
      "to_name": "Alex",
      "content": "Thank you for asking! My favorite recipe has to be my secret one.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:23:46.552944+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's great to hear! I've been busy with work, so I didn't have much time for myself. How about you?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:24:04.805982+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That's great to hear! I have a wonderful boyfriend. Do you? How do you meet him?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:25:39.855201+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh my, you have a boyfriend?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:26:12.220426+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh my! I didn't know you had a boyfriend. But, how do we meet? What is his name?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:27:35.285290+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh my! That's surprising. What are you talking about? I don't have a boyfriend.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:32:32.378559+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh my! You don't have a boyfriend? What kind of relationships do you like to have?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:36:11.886909+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's interesting. Do you have any friends or family you like to spend time with? I like spending time with my close friends.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:36:54.802534+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Of course I would. That's why I met him on Tinder, right?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:37:39.118171+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yes, I can understand. But is it okay to talk like that? 'Of course I would.' It seems kind of casual. I usually don't use that word.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:38:27.235683+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I really don't understand. What's wrong with the word?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:40:46.988867+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I understand what you mean, Emily. My language is a bit different from yours.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:42:12.305869+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "alex-reply-fb57f251966947d6a50e8ed64631714a",
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 3,
      "to_name": "Alex",
      "content": "Yeah, that's okay. Do you have any kids or siblings? Like, do you have a wife and kids?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:46:44.720888+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, I like it! So, do you have any hobbies or activities that you like to do in your free time?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:49:46.071544+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I enjoy reading books on historical topics, but I also like to do hiking in my free time. What are your hobbies and interests?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:52:07.751471+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I love reading books on historical topics! It's so interesting to learn about the past. Do you also like historical movies?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:56:11.052625+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I also love reading historical books and watching films about the past, but I find it harder to maintain my attention in movies because they change characters too fast. I like historical novels a bit more.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T12:57:56.379808+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Of course I would. What are you talking about?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T13:03:34.573221+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What's the word you use for 'of course'? It's a bit more formal. You could say 'I definitely would.' That sounds a bit less casual.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T13:08:33.348996+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh my, I see. You've had a boyfriend before? It sounds like a very interesting story. I mean, I definitely have a boyfriend and we've been together for a couple of years now.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T13:47:24.324292+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, I had my first boyfriend when I was 18. We were just teenagers. Do you have any friends or family you like to hang out with? You know, like your own family.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T13:57:04.353507+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh my, I see. You had a first boyfriend when you were 18? That's interesting to hear.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T14:03:52.323663+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yes, I definitely would.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T14:09:31.605342+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, I definitely would",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T14:11:21.540280+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I would be happy to.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T14:33:02.168199+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I am sorry, I didn't catch that. Could you say it again?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T14:38:21.921813+00:00"
    },
